# Linux Disk Usage Monitoring Using Bash

## Project Overview

This project is a Linux disk monitoring automation script developed using Bash scripting.

It monitors disk usage across mounted filesystems and generates warning messages when disk utilization reaches or exceeds a predefined threshold of 80%.

## Technologies Used

- Linux
- Bash Scripting
- Git
- GitHub
- AWK
- Linux Disk Utilities

## Project Features

- Monitors disk utilization across filesystems.
- Uses a configurable disk usage threshold.
- Generates warning messages when disk usage exceeds the threshold.
- Displays normal disk usage status.
- Helps administrators identify potential disk space issues.

